My work ends.
I am leaving the office.
I walk to the bus stop.
People are waiting for the bus there.
I also stand with them.
The sun is setting now.
The evening sky is very beautiful.
After a while, my bus arrives.
I am boarding the bus.
I am buying a ticket from the conductor.
The bus moves forward.
I am looking outside through the window.
The streets of Kochi are very busy now.
Lights are turning on in the shops.
I like this evening journey very much.
